# Roadmap SoT

[`.specs/project/ROADMAP.md`](../../.specs/project/ROADMAP.md) is the **milestone status SoT**: current status, done-summary index, compact historical archive with links to feature specs.

It is **not** a `tasks.md` mirror, feature dump, CLI encyclopedia, or deferred-backlog inventory.

**Ownership:** [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Milestone tags (`M##`) **are allowed**.

## Forbidden in ROADMAP.md

- `Artifacts:`, `Sisters`, `IDs:` / `HOTSPOT-*`, `Depth:`, `Priority:` laundry in archive entries
- `Out of scope:`, `Final gate` / repeated gate process noise, `Suggested execution order`
- `Further horizon` Deferred lists (pointer to STATE only)
- Task checkboxes mirroring `tasks.md`; `Post-* backlog` for already-Done work

## Allowed

- Current table; Done summary; Archive entries in the template below
- One-line supersession notes (detail stays in the feature spec)

## Entry template

```markdown
## Milestone N — Name — DONE

→ [`.specs/features/<slug>/spec.md`](../features/<slug>/spec.md)

One-line outcome.

- Up to 3–5 capability bullets (not tasks)
```

Sync rules: [roadmap-sync.md](../skills/vitals-common/references/roadmap-sync.md).

## Sync rule

1. Add or mark milestones with the template — do not paste Artifacts / HOTSPOT / Out of scope / gate / tasks.
2. Self-check: *Is this already in `context.md`, `tasks.md`, or STATE?* If yes → do not put it in ROADMAP.

Editorial lint: [living-sot-doc.mjs](../hooks/lib/living-sot-doc.mjs) `lintRoadmapDoc`.
